# ── MHD Košice — environment variables ───────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env` and fill in as needed. `.env` is git-ignored.

# Google Maps API key.
#   • NOT needed for development in Expo Go, or for any iOS build (Apple Maps).
#   • Needed ONLY for a production Android build (Google Play), where
#     react-native-maps uses Google Maps.
#   • Consumed by app.config.js -> android.config.googleMaps.apiKey.
#   • Prefer an EAS secret over a committed value:  eas secret:create
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
